WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.077
Playing someone this weekend? Here's how to add them as an opponent.

00:00:04.527 --> 00:00:06.847
On My Opponents, tap Add Opponent.

00:00:07.297 --> 00:00:10.619
Search FIDE by their name, or by their FIDE ID.

00:00:11.069 --> 00:00:13.004
Type the name, and tap Search.

00:00:13.454 --> 00:00:15.603
Pick the right player from the results.

00:00:16.053 --> 00:00:22.084
Add their Chess.com or Lichess username if you know it, then tap Create and import games.

00:00:22.534 --> 00:00:27.285
We fetch their tournament games from chess-results. You can leave the page while it runs.

00:00:27.735 --> 00:00:31.271
Their ratings come straight from FIDE. Tap View All Games,

00:00:31.721 --> 00:00:36.131
and every game is there, with filters for colour, result, opening and year.

00:00:36.581 --> 00:00:40.479
Then prepare, or play their bot. chesspreparatory.com.
